	"data": "Cybernautics Business Plan\n\nWhat It Is\nThe business model and operational plan for Cybernautics — cithoreal's content/dev brand. Distilled from OneNote planning documents (pre-vault era).\n\nBusiness Areas\nFrom [[OneNote/Cybernautics/Main Business/Brainstorm]]:\nPodcast — flagship content format\nYouTube — video content, dev logs, tutorials\nStreaming — Twitch / live development\nBlog Articles — written content\nApps — XR/spatial computing apps\n\"Metaverse\" / Spatial Internet — XR experiences and…",
